{"id": "1825780", "name": "גבול עליון ותחתון של סדרה מתכנסת a+b/n", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה הסדרה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\displaystyle a_n={{CT:0}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו את הגבול העליון ואת הגבול התחתון של הסדרה.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle \\overline{\\lim}a_n = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle \\underline{\\lim}a_n = \\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">כל אחד משני הערכים נבדק בנפרד, ולכן ניתן לקבל ניקוד חלקי.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">סדרה מתכנסת</b><br><p>מאחר ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle \\frac{{{CT:1}}}{n}\\to0\\)</span>, מתקיים</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\displaystyle a_n={{CT:2}}+\\frac{{{CT:1}}}{n}\\longrightarrow {{CT:2}} \\]</p><p>בסדרה מתכנסת הגבול העליון והגבול התחתון שווים לגבול הסדרה עצמה.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\displaystyle \\overline{\\lim}a_n=\\underline{\\lim}a_n={{CT:2}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\">[[feedback:prt1]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "limsup", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.5, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הגבול העליון נכון.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הגבול העליון אינו נכון.</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "liminf", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.5, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הגבול התחתון נכון.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הגבול התחתון אינו נכו